+
+    Replace assets/img/header-logo.svg with assets/img/logos/GreenNorthlogo-transparent.png globally.
+
+    Replace Modern Factory Operation Innovative Facility. with Empowering Nigeria\'s Energy Sector Through Excellence
+
+    Replace <div class="circular-text btn_wrapper"> with <div class="circular-text btn_wrapper" style="display: none;"> (this safely hides the spinning wheel without breaking the JS).
+
+    Replace </head> with <style>:root { --primary-color1: #07a606 !important; } .mega-menu, .sub-menu { display: none !important; }</style></head> (this forcefully applies the green logo color across the entire site and hides the template's annoying dropdown menus to create a clean top-level navigation).
